            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Robot Park makes tangible the 'space' axis among the IP, technology, space and data that Galaxy Corporation holds, and it is where Physical AI technology meets revenue. It is the place where artist IP and humanoid-robot technology come together on a single stage. The company's overall business structure is laid out in the Company core FAQ and the Enter-Tech whitepaper ."
          }
        }
      ]
